- tui_gateway/fleet_tui_composition.py: explicit default-off composition root
  (owner+hub+service+4 handlers+hooks); resolver reads the REAL server registry
  (exactly one live, client-bearing session; detached-WS sessions excluded);
  guarded enable; scoped rollback (stale disable never touches newer globals;
  hub deactivated).
- service: TOCTOU guard in activate() — a close in the resolve→attach window
  tears the fresh association down and denies (no orphan association, no wedge).
- canary tests: 7 (disabled baseline / enable+attach+real close+replay+detach /
  fail-closed zero-ambiguous-forged / rollback incl. hub-owner-service state /
  guard+scoped disable / non-shutdown reason mapping / detached-WS exclusion).
- S2: +window test (23 passed). Group 224 passed; ruff clean.
- Independent owner/security review: 1 major + 4 minor fixed; not-proven items
  recorded for the Fase 2 evidence notes.
